<div class="flex min-h-[calc(100vh-5.5rem)] flex-col justify-center">
<div class="container bg-zinc-800 flex flex-col w-full mx-auto">


<div class="">
<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Моя звать Леонид.</h1>
